   "id": "2026-11-06-care-guide",
   "date": "2026-11-06",
   "type": "carousel",
   "pillar": "care",
   "title": "4 habits that make your tawa last",
   "slides": [
    {
     "src": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Du5wwrdWjcyZSjZvAB6BzDNRDJ/hf_20261028_195121_a819ce25-b139-4444-9716-c5c805a14a15.png",
     "layout": "cover",
     "kicker": "Care guide",
     "headline": "4 habits that make\nyour tawa *last.*",
     "body": "Ten seconds a day. Swipe."
    },
    {
     "src": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Du5wwrdWjcyZSjZvAB6BzDNRDJ/hf_20261028_195120_42bb235c-4c9b-48af-aa1d-e6153cc30e81.png",
     "layout": "text",
     "number": "01",
     "kicker": "Wood or silicone only",
     "headline": "Keep metal off the surface.",
     "body": "Use wooden or silicone spatulas. No knives, forks or steel spoons, and don't cut food in the pan."
    },
    {
     "src": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Du5wwrdWjcyZSjZvAB6BzDNRDJ/hf_20261028_195311_9e2571d3-bb40-4de3-8a02-870c477fb97d.png",
     "layout": "text",
     "number": "02",
     "kicker": "Low to medium flame",
     "headline": "Gentle heat does the work.",
     "body": "Preheat for 1 to 2 minutes on low-to-medium. Don't leave it empty on a high flame."
    },
    {
     "src": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Du5wwrdWjcyZSjZvAB6BzDNRDJ/hf_20261028_195728_de28c4cb-b9a5-4392-8a3e-7bf25ea64825.png",
     "layout": "text",
     "number": "03",
     "kicker": "Cool, then wash",
     "headline": "Soft sponge, warm soapy water.",
     "body": "Let it cool first, cold water on a hot pan shocks the iron. No steel wool or scourers."
    },
    {
     "src": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Du5wwrdWjcyZSjZvAB6BzDNRDJ/hf_20261028_195728_a24404fb-0e73-4850-8220-a47c729e7d56.png",
     "layout": "text",
     "number": "04",
     "kicker": "Dry and hang",
     "headline": "Dry fully. Hang by the loop.",
     "body": "Water left on the surface leaves marks. Hang it, or stack with a cloth in between."
    },
    {
     "src": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3Du5wwrdWjcyZSjZvAB6BzDNRDJ/hf_20261028_195121_a819ce25-b139-4444-9716-c5c805a14a15.png",
     "layout": "closing",
     "headline": "Look after it, and\nit *looks after you.*",
     "body": "Every piece is backed by a 1-year replacement warranty."
    }
   ],
   "caption": "Want your tawa to look new for years? Four small habits.\n\n1. Wooden or silicone spatulas only\n2. Low-to-medium flame, 1 to 2 minute preheat\n3. Let it cool, then wash with a soft sponge\n4. Dry it fully and hang it by the loop\n\nDo this, and your 1-year replacement warranty has your back too.\n\nSave this for later. Full care guide at tawaana.com",
   "hashtags": [
    "#Tawaana",
